      "description": {
        "fun": "Munchlax eats its own body weight in food every day, gulping it down without chewing and rarely feeling full. It hides snacks in its long fur and then forgets about them, and it raids villages for food that was going to be thrown away. It was the first Generation 4 Pokémon shown to the public, in May 2004, and appeared in four games before its own generation arrived.",
